with helper:
```python
def run_json(tool: Path, args: list):
    p = subprocess.run([sys.executable, str(tool), *args], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=300)
    i = p.stdout.find("{")
    if i < 0: return {}
    try: return json.loads(p.stdout[i:])
    except json.JSONDecodeError: return {}
```

